ReWatch IoT grew out of the ULTRON smart-house project and keeps its
Apache-2.0 licence. Parts of the passkey (WebAuthn) authentication module,
the local-CA script and the ESP32-C3 indicator firmware (boot animation,
ECG trace) are carried over from ULTRON.

This product includes software developed by third parties, under their own
licences. The inventory — dependency licences and the SIL Open Font License
1.1 text covering the self-hosted typefaces the dashboard serves — is in
THIRD_PARTY.md.

Mosquitto and nftables are invoked as separate processes. They are not
included in, linked against, or redistributed with this work.
